WEBVTT

00:03:58.121 --> 00:04:01.871
That’s right, throw
some ja-la-penos on there,

00:04:01.913 --> 00:04:03.788
I like my pizza spicy!”

00:04:03.829 --> 00:04:04.829
(Laughter)

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.413
I met my husband on a cruise ship,

00:04:08.413 --> 00:04:09.413
I got married,

00:04:09.413 --> 00:04:12.329
I just celebrated two years
of being married not too long ago.

00:04:12.371 --> 00:04:14.663
Yes, you can clap,

00:04:14.704 --> 00:04:16.079
I like him.

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:17.079
(Laughter)

00:04:17.079 --> 00:04:20.204
I appreciate the pause you took
to make sure I was happy, though.

00:04:20.204 --> 00:04:21.204
Good job.

00:04:21.204 --> 00:04:22.788
You were like, “Is she all right?

00:04:22.788 --> 00:04:24.079
Oh, no, he’s a good dude.”

00:04:25.329 --> 00:04:27.038
I will tell you this:

00:04:27.038 --> 00:04:29.329
planning a wedding
was the most stressful thing

00:04:29.329 --> 00:04:30.663
I’ve ever done in my life.